WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:05.030
You don't need accounts, passwords or a
big budget to run a Thinkerwell lesson.

2
00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:07.490
Here's a session, from start to finish.

3
00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:12.310
Before the first session, set
up each tablet or laptop once,

4
00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:14.350
with the checklist under For educators.

5
00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:17.150
Thinkerwell saves the
lessons on the device,

6
00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:18.910
so they work without the internet.

7
00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:21.530
Learners can share a device.

8
00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:25.090
Each one taps their name, and
their work stays on that device.

9
00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:27.160
Pick any lesson.

10
00:00:27.347 --> 00:00:30.740
Its teacher guide has a
plan for 30 or 45 minutes,

11
00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:31.780
with the answers.

12
00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:34.870
Then learners work through five steps.

13
00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:37.610
They read, in standard or simpler English.

14
00:00:37.822 --> 00:00:38.720
They write.

15
00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:40.390
They talk it through with a partner.

16
00:00:40.582 --> 00:00:42.990
They watch a short video,
or read it instead.

17
00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:44.220
And they reflect.

18
00:00:45.287 --> 00:00:47.730
Afterwards, see where
every learner is up to.

19
00:00:47.883 --> 00:00:50.150
There are no scores,
just lessons finished.

20
00:00:51.239 --> 00:00:52.770
No devices that day?

21
00:00:52.909 --> 00:00:56.130
Every lesson and teacher guide
prints in black and white.

22
00:00:57.260 --> 00:00:59.290
Thinkerwell is free, with no ads.

23
00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:01.270
Social studies and beyond.

24
00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:04.530
Everything for teachers
is at thinkerwell.app,

25
00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:06.320
under For educators.

